[A.]

~[IsunBalloon.a1]<h2>**The Cometh**</h2>
<i>"Keep your friends close....and your enimies even closer"</i>
--Some guy said it about 4000 years ago.

<p>Ok, so get this:  You and Luitenent Wind step into the virtual reality prototype thing to practice for the big war thats gonna happen, when, you are inturupted half way through your simulation!  You step out on your island to see the whole Sky is flooded with sky demons!!!  There are battles going on as far as the eye can see, but now you must concentrate on the thunder demon, and the demon master, Thundus, that have come between you and Luitenent wind!  Good luck, you'll need it!

$Button=EQUIPMENT,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Kick some demon ass!,DoNothing,0

[Ai3Templedead]
<h2>Incoming Message:</h2>
You still are no match for the rest of us!!!

[Ai3PriestDead]
<h2>Incoming Message:</h2>
I may be gone, but Thundus will prevail!!!!!

[Ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message From Luitenent Wind:</h2>
Almost got him!!!  Did I mention the destruction of Thunder will abolish the existance of all thunder demons???

[Ai4TempleDead]
