His temple is gone, now lets get his priest!!!!

[Ai4PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message From Luitenent Wind:</h2>
Good!  Now sacrafice him and all the Thunder Demons will be no more!

[Succeeded][Ai4PriestDead]
